*.zip
# =============================================================================
# Universal .gitignore
# Covers: OS, editors/IDEs, Python, Rust, Go, Node/JS, Java, C/C++, ML/data
# science artifacts, Docker, Terraform, secrets, logs, and more.
# =============================================================================


